* ''The fiction and the art take their own o-takiage'' (operator ruling, 2026-11-01). The RPG chapters and the concept art keep an o-takiage rite fitted to their own wiki domains, designed from the pono sweep, and the lares design laws never bind them by default. Item `L20`.

